@startuml resolve
' SPEC: _spec/apps/ui/starchess/resolve.puml
' purpose: Rank-major classical resolve — king-checks → B → C (attack → death → occupy → move) → F.
!include ../../../themes/proveo.puml

title StarChess · Resolve — attack → death → occupy

start

:Take planning snap — turn N queue\nwith moves + specials for both sides;

:Turn-start **legal king-checks** — fog-visible, implicit,\nwhite then black (""applyPendingKingShots"");

:Apply rank **B** specials — white then black\n(spawn / mine / warp / siege);

:Rank **C** — classical for both sides against\nthe same start board (""resolveTurn"");

:Attack phase — targets read from the **start** board:\nvisible from the start square, or a path-reveal shot\nfired from the discovery square ("":fog lifts along the path"");

if (attack hits a piece?) then (yes)
  :Death — victim removed;
  if (attacker survives?) then (yes)
    :**Occupy** victim's square;
  else (no)
    :Attacker dies first —\nsquare stays empty, no occupy;
  endif
else (no)
  :Quiet move;
endif

:Move phase — survivors relocate; collisions resolved\nagainst the post-attack board; a target **still fogged at\ncontact** → move collision (capture/occupy, no attack cue);

:Apply rank **F** specials — white then black\n(post-move siege / late drops);

:Serialize optional history\n""C=from intentTo>resolvedTo"" (pending);

stop

note right
  **Intent ""C="" vs progressive path resolve:** ""pathRevealSteps"" /
  ""pathRevealFrom"" in ""resolveTurn"" capture the fog approach — the
  tank moves as an approach then attacks from the discovery square,
  all inside the **attack** phase.
  **King shots:** ""collectLegalKingChecks"" + ""applyPendingKingShots""
  at turn start. Implicit check → turn-start HP (legal geometry at
  ""endScTurn"", before B); no king-aimed ""C="".
end note
@enduml
